{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OQtzk3DR62O-h8voZG0DNg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.705781+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OQtzk3DR62O-h8voZG0DNg","html":"<div><h1><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/L9Y8ZbwxVKVvfviaLsnToiboOM98ItkiaEnn5ibfxvN9JaJzxdofpVuEAxEMEoflpcAodqiacxWpr97u3eicEnKe7DvA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;randomid=oywsx0vx&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=0\"/></span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5NzA3MzYwNA==&amp;mid=2652267449&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8132343f31a2ee615418082e1df6bf37&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/L9Y8ZbwxVKVP4EdibwvHibBaUrSnzfHjW5Ktca5KJMKdmI7cHtzTarhRZsgg47FJzHFRRKzVH3ZgMO1hMYVWYHLg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;randomid=i60dsdkr&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=1\"/></span></a><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>为加深全国广大考生对我院硕士研究生招生学科</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>专业)、科研平台、师资队伍和培养特色等内容的了解，促进不同高校间的交流和优秀人才的选拔深造，</span></span><span><span><span>暨南大学第一临床医学院拟于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年暑期举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。</span></span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一、</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>开营时间</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5日</span></span><span><span><span>-8</span></span><span><span>月6日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>二、</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>即日起至</span></span><span><span>7月29日。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>三、</span></strong><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>全日制 2027届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span><span>（要求为临床医学</span></span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span>医学/生命科学相关专业）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有浓厚科研兴趣，有较强的研究能力</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>专业成绩排名和综合素质排名均在本专业名列前茅</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>四、</span></strong><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>暨南大学第一临床医学院（又名暨南大学附属第一医院、广州华侨医院），是 “华侨最高学府”、中央统战部、教育部、广东省共建的国家“双一流”建设高校暨南大学的直属附属医院。医院是一所集医疗、教学、科研、预防、保健和康复于一体的三级甲等综合医院。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/YOnaicY5K4Urj6DgahFLic332kCU1UdMoKt6Sg8agQvXYncEoOWiaAbMUhnfjIAIcJCd7T3XTcibKIkNj2AKzFqrNH3dhTD2DjH0VBwqf8lbH1E/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><strong><span><span>医院全景</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span><span>医院位于广州市天河区</span></span><span>CBD中心地带，共有2个院区（院本部、东圃院区）、5个门诊（院本部门诊、东圃院区门诊、皮肤医学美容中心、暨大校门诊部、暨大番禺校区门诊部）、3个托管医院（潮汕医院、粤西医院、北部湾医院）。</span><span><span>院本部开放病床</span></span><span><span><span>1941</span></span><span><span>张，作为天河区城市医疗集团总医院以及“港澳药械通”指定医疗机构，医院以广州为核心基点，构建全方位国际化医疗服务体系，服务范围深度覆盖粤港澳大湾区，并广泛辐射至国内诸地及海外，为全球患者的健康保驾护航。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>医院作为暨南大学第一临床医学院，依据</span><strong><span>暨南大学“侨校</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>+</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>名校”的战略定位，其临床医学专业成为海外、港澳台地区的境外医学生首选的学科之一</span></strong></span><span><span>。澳门公立医院75%</span></span><span><span>的执业医师接受过医院的临床医学教育与培训。在非本地培养的香港执业医师中，毕业于暨大的临床医学生超过1/10。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>医院学科门类齐全，专科特色鲜明，为广东省医学会副会长单位，形成了</span><strong><span>神经内科、骨科、普外科和医学影像科四大“旗舰学科”</span></strong><span>。拥有2</span></span><span>个国家级临床重点专科建设项目（神经内科、骨科），1个国家中医药局中西医结合“旗舰”科室建设项目（中医科），24个省级临床重点学科和专科，3个广州市重大疑难罕见疾病诊疗中心。</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/YOnaicY5K4Uock4ERg8p5pwric4Ja2Igs8QsibeCtJh3HBtt6cjoU7iaicbqzHuvVlS5hBDexVM6FicqPARibEfOwDIjFfuRTJoyyIz8dz6wdBc1qw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><strong><span><span>医院门诊</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>五、</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>教学科研实力</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>在教学科研方面</span></strong><span>，医院学科建设积淀雄厚。拥有</span><strong><span>博士导师</span></strong><strong><span>142</span></strong></span><strong><span>名，硕士导师</span></strong><strong><span>217</span></strong><strong><span>名</span></strong><span><span>。医院设有26</span></span><span>个住院医师规范化培训专业基地，</span><span><span>是广东省最早开展住院医师培训的基地之一，也是</span><strong><span>全国首批国家级住院医师规范化培训基地、全科医师培训基地、全国首批国家级神经外科专科医师培训基地</span></strong><span>。拥有临床医学一级学科博士点，临床医学和护理学2</span></span><span>个一级学科硕士点，具有临床医学博士专业学位授权和博士后科研流动站。获批国家教育部、卫健委第一批临床医学硕士专业学位研究生培养模式改革试点单位、第一批卓越医生教育培养计划项目试点单位、广东省首批高水平临床医学院；教育部、国家卫健委认定的首批高校附属医院“国家临床教学培训示范中心”。临床技能综合培训中心被教育部授予国家大学生校外实践教育基地、广东省实验教学示范中心、广东省虚拟仿真实验教学中心。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>在暨南大学双一流医药学科群建设引领下，医院依托</span><strong><span>14</span></strong></span><strong><span>个重点实验室</span></strong><span><span>（2</span></span><span>个全国重点实验室合作实验室，12个省部级重点实验室平台）及国家、省级重点学科，形成以高水平医院建设为中心的创新联合体。医院建有临床医学研究院，拥有一批海内外引进的高水平专职研究人员，专用研究场地6000多平方米；配备9.4T小动物核磁共振、回旋加速器、动物PET-CT、流式细胞仪等一批高尖端研究设备。近年来，医院科学研究水平不断提高，成果产出丰硕，获国家科学技术进步奖二等奖1项，省部级科研成果一等奖6项、二等奖26项、三等奖45项，在Nature、NEJM、Cell Mol、Nature Communication等国际著名期刊发表原创论文。获批千万级科研项目3项，国家自然科学基金逐年增加。暨大临床医学进入ESI全球排名前1.11‰。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎全国优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong title=\"\"><span>六、</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>（一）填写报名申请表（扫下方二维码下载申请表）</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/YOnaicY5K4UrGQQvricGTNiborWuC5OqMsNDvWj97SdQ99CWoSIia4GPCb3RLIz3zbficWHgLSAztr9r8zib44WRFzVaF6s9PiaG9ia6hE3pDFHHlAA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span><span>暨南大学第一临床医学院</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>（二）填写报名申请问卷并提交申请材料（扫下方二维码填写申请问卷）。</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/YOnaicY5K4UqiaQ3IqJBgH7v6EHkk06sBGBOyhyQpl8HqjMIicg4dwM5q3qhjcw8btY8JlW9RYibk0zgLqss9cXlFk8u4ibFHcFx19D2JywTvWt0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>申请问卷填写</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>七、</span><strong title=\"\"></strong></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>审核流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>我院将对申请人材料进行审核，审核通过者将于</span></span><span><span>8月3日在医院公告栏公布并通过邮件通知，请申请人留意邮件。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>八、</span></strong><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/YOnaicY5K4UoEH2VZQYkibDdqtq3k8SjQdwxMpB2UECAsicoxRL6RPBC8EI5KldOWiaEvFy4scwaIPxRqxOd2ZzibqvpnEV32usxEiaB8Ufg43tlM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>九、</span></strong><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动说明</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>以上活动日程为初定计划，具体安排可能适当调整。</span></span></p><p><span><span>广州本地高校学生交通住宿费自理；广州市外高校学生由我院统一安排住宿，交通费自理。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>十、</span></strong><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>地址：广州市天河区黄埔大道西</span></span><span><span>613号</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>020-38688039邱老师、020-38688976范老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>jdfyypxb@126.com</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>供稿部门：毕业后教育与研究生管理科</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑：黄   璇、欧晓琴</span></span></p><section><span><span>初审：王   丹</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核：罗志权</span></span></section><section><span><span>审定发布：</span><span><span>尹海燕</span></span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></h1><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OQtzk3DR62O-h8voZG0DNg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/L9Y8ZbwxVKVicZfulZIYKibpDlnRX3nicWUn1ISX54STQdy8GeaUxMOj4OOLDL19J0qSORHEFEnGbmicGuwzibG8iboQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;randomid=ldil2hbf&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=7\"/></a></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/L9Y8ZbwxVKVoU2ic9FBCPeeiaIbPTvMrNMibSahF4xhDeLy3k2J6GDHdvfWc6criaLe2YNjoFbcnjvDK1ibthLE62Jw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;randomid=gp8dovys&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=8\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"936471f0764801d0beae3de46a11c915bd392251527f6556345e8a772c6b7c2d","textLength":1964,"sourceSha256":"ac5453a01e76f3b5720d557c4b50ad6df912c15483a4b5bae6455d140311119c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e5d49fc6a24326cc243","title":"2026年暨南大学第一临床医学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.705781+00:00"}
